%% One screen in REST = 3 requests in 2 trips. The app joins the data.
flowchart LR
  APP[Mobile app · opens product page] -->|trip 1| P[GET /v1/products/1 · has sellerId]
  APP -->|trip 1| R[GET reviews · last 3]
  P -->|trip 2| S[GET /v1/sellers/1 · needs sellerId]
  S --> JOIN[App joins the data · client side]
  R --> JOIN
  JOIN --> SCREEN[200 screen ready · 3 requests, 2 trips]
